Encounter1Enemies:
UNIT MonsterGeneric Airfly 0x0 Level(12,Enemy,1) [15,11] 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0 [VenomScales] NoAI
UNIT

ALIGN 4

BeginningScene:
InitializeNathan(1,1)
ENUT WaitEventTrapsFlag
LABEL 0x2
EndEvent

Encounter1:
BeginCombatEncounter
LOAD3 0x0 Encounter1Units; ENUN
LoadUnitsByDifficulty(Encounter1Enemies,Encounter1Enemies,Encounter1Enemies)
CreateArenaBorders(13,8,21,15)
FADU 16
MUSC Song_InspectingTheResoundingWeapons
SetMapBGM(Song_InspectingTheResoundingWeapons)
EndEvent


UnitCleanup:
FADI 16
ClearArenaBorders
CLEA 0
ResetNathan
FADU 16
MUSC Song_FrozenGrounds
SetMapBGM(Song_FrozenGrounds)
EndEvent


EndingScene:
SystemText(NextFloorOneWay)
IfNoSelectedGoto(0x1)
MNC3 Stratum3F4
GOTO 0x2
LABEL 0x1
FADI 16; InitializeNathan(8,12); FADU 16
LABEL 0x2
EndEvent




